---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import LegacyHeader from '../components/LegacyHeader.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactSection from '../components/ContactSection.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import ButtonPrimary from '../components/ButtonPrimary.astro';
import ButtonSecondary from '../components/ButtonSecondary.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="SEO Case Studies | Bright Forge" description="Search Console case studies: clicks, coverage and CTR. Read the evidence, then send your site if you want the same diagnosis.">
  <LegacyHeader slot="header" />

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <Hero
    title="<span>Case Studies</span>"
    breadcrumbCurrent="Case Studies"
  >
    <Fragment slot="story">
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Search results and AI referral reports, with the evidence in context.</p>
      <p>Read the comparison periods, the page-level findings and the limits behind each headline. The collection includes Search Console comparisons, campaign accounts and AI referral report reviews. We label recommendations separately from completed work and distinguish recorded clicks or events from confirmed enquiries and sales.</p>
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="actions">
      <ButtonPrimary href="#case-studies-grid" text="Browse Case Studies" />
      <ButtonSecondary href="/contact/" text="Get Your Free Audit" />
    </Fragment>
  </Hero>

  <section class="case-study-proof-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-study-proof-card">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Proof with context</p>
          <h2>How to read these <span>case studies</span></h2>
          <p>A search comparison can show more clicks alongside lower CTR or worse average position. An AI referral report can identify useful pages to review without proving a sale. Read those trade-offs before deciding which questions apply to your own website.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-points">
          <article><strong>Diagnosis before activity</strong><span>Technical blockers, intent gaps and weak page structure get separated before work begins.</span></article>
          <article><strong>Commercial pages first</strong><span>Service, category and local pages usually carry more value than generic blog volume.</span></article>
          <article><strong>Traffic needs a job</strong><span>Rankings matter, but the page still needs proof, clarity and a clear enquiry path.</span></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Modern Filter & Grid Section -->
  <section class="case-studies-section">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Explore Our SEO <span>Case Studies</span></h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Filter by industry, then check the source, comparison window and metric definition. Search clicks, AI referrals and confirmed customer outcomes answer different questions.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Modern Filter Buttons -->
      <div class="filter-container">
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="all">All Industries</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="beauty">Beauty & Wellness</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="consulting">Business Consulting</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="fitness">Fitness</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="automotive">Automotive</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="ecommerce">E-commerce</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="local">Local Services</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="construction">Construction</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="industrial">Industrial</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="legal">Legal</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="sports">Sports</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="bridal">Bridal</button>
        <button class="modern-filter-btn" data-filter="ai-search">AI Search</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Modern Case Studies Grid -->
      <div id="case-studies-grid" class="case-studies-grid">
        <article class="modern-case-card construction" data-category="construction">
          <div class="card-image-container"><img src="/images/case-studies/custom-home-builder-search-growth-gsc-evidence.png" alt="Redacted Search Console totals for a custom home builder" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div class="card-overlay"><span class="view-case-btn">View Case Study →</span></div><div class="industry-badge"><span>Construction</span></div></div>
          <div class="card-content"><div class="card-header"><h3 class="card-title">Custom Home Builder</h3><div class="growth-indicator positive">+33.8%</div></div><p class="card-description">Added 2,433 organic clicks. Impressions and CTR increased while blended average position worsened; the totals do not establish why.</p><div class="metrics-grid"><div class="metric-item"><span class="metric-value">9,634</span><span class="metric-label">Clicks</span></div><div class="metric-item"><span class="metric-value">+2,433</span><span class="metric-label">Extra clicks</span></div><div class="metric-item"><span class="metric-value">90 days</span><span class="metric-label">Timeframe</span></div></div><a href="/case-studies/custom-home-builder-search-growth/" class="modern-cta-btn"><span>Read Case Study</span><svg class="cta-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="modern-case-card industrial" data-category="industrial">
          <div class="card-image-container"><img src="/images/case-studies/pvc-building-products-search-growth-gsc-evidence.png" alt="Redacted Search Console totals for a building-products supplier" class="card-image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div class="card-overlay"><span class="view-case-btn">View Case Study →</span></div><div class="industry-badge"><span>Industrial</span></div></div>
